  "sourceReadingNotes": [
    "Davison pair discussions supply contact-specific meaning; general aspect discussions qualify it.",
    "Jansky Mercury examples are explicitly identified as method rather than Mercury-Mars case evidence.",
    "Jansky supplies a direct Mars-Saturn square example and separately discusses continuing transits; no transit timing is imported.",
    "Module 18 was reread as a secondary comparison but not used as source authority for these detail records.",
    "The Greene PDF body was not text-readable beyond print markers in the available extraction and is not claimed as an interpretive source."
